  "chapterId": "puc1-chemistry-05-thermodynamics",
  "topicId": "puc1-chemistry-05-thermodynamics.t1",
  "stem": {
   "en": "A system releases 100 J of heat while 250 J of work is done on it. ΔU of the system is:"
